:: You [markdown]

## Character Creation

Your name? <<textbox "$p.name" "First">> <<textbox "$p.surname" "Surname">>
Pronouns? <<dropdown "$p.pn">>
<<options $p.pronouns[]>>
<</dropdown>>

When people describe you, what words do they use to do so? If something is not checked, that means the opposite is true (if Kind is false, Cynical is true, if introverted is false, extroverted is true etcetera), just something to keep in mind. Ambiverted, being mute in any capacity and Takes Things Literally are the only ones this isn't true for.
<br>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.kind" false true autocheck>> Kind</label>
<br>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.experienced" false true autocheck>> Experienced</label>
The above can change throughout your playthrough, this is just for the start. Over 25 different <<nobr>><<adult>>sexual<</adult>> <<notadult>>sensual<</notadult>><</nobr>> scenes triggers Experienced "on."
<br>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.open" false true autocheck>> Open-minded (opposite: Prude)<label>

